{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"This pet needs emergency placement. Please click here to go to our emergency placement page for more information.\n\nTwinkle Toes is on the at-risk list due to behavior concerns. In the care center, Twinkle Toes has shown significant kennel stress and high arousal, including repetitive spinning, bouncing off the kennel walls and door, jumping, barking, heavy panting, and hard pulling on leash. She has also displayed lunging and hard barking toward dogs outside of the care center as well as jumping on staff incessantly during walks. Twinkle Toes responds well to training and is consistently able to redirect and engage with handlers using pattern games, touch, and engage/disengage work and is highly social with staff and her favorite volunteers. Medically, Twinkle Toes is apparently healthy.\n\nSince I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Visit me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=11&searchType=4&animalid=198044","id":"79a4926fd763df131b42ca674678261f","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/9a36c5c8bbf34ec9bb62ed46d63aa1b3-1793310683-1793310690-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/9a18da0e7da1403d94c7bb662d7c1190-1789397575-1793208742-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5c93561aa1a34501a0f9632eb5120d84-1791730663-1791730663-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/cafe4a3c3fa5452db607edba8690e68c-1791730663-1791730663-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/579048974a764a789656115b69caca31-1791730663-1791730663-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shel